[center][size=6][b]RNG LANDS — 简体中文补丁[/b][/size]
[size=5][b]Simplified Chinese Translation Patch[/b][/size]
[size=4]v1.0 · 适用于 RNG Lands 0.7.2 · Elden Ring 1.17.x[/size][/center]

[line]

[b][size=5]中文说明[/size][/b]

本补丁为 [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/3229]RNG Lands[/url]（Nexus mod 3229）提供[b]简体中文[/b]文本：
物品名与说明、随机生成的故事说明、菜单、教程与系统提示均已翻译。
补丁[b]只包含翻译文本[/b]（msg/zhocn 下的 DCX 文件），不包含原 mod 的任何文件。

[b]覆盖率[/b]
[list]
[*]约 155 万条文本槽位（16 个内容组）全部有中文；
[*]其中约 33.9 万条为[b]官方简中继承[/b]（与原版游戏文本逐字一致处），其余为项目译文；
[*]物品名/说明、随机故事、菜单、HUD 与教程提示均已覆盖。
[/list]

[b]需要 / Requirements[/b]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/3229]RNG Lands 0.7.2[/url]（必须安装原 mod）；
[*]Elden Ring 1.17.x；
[*]游戏语言必须设为[b]简体中文[/b]（否则游戏读取英文 engus，补丁不会生效）；
[*]推荐 / 普通难度（recommended increased difficulty / vanilla difficulty）都支持。
[/list]

[b]安装 / Installation[/b]
[list]
[*]1. 先安装原版 RNG Lands（Nexus 3229）。
[*]2. 下载与本补丁页面对应的文件（按你安装的 RNG Lands 版本选择：Ruby / Apache / Pack 10）。
[*]3. 解压并合并到你 RNG Lands 的 mod 根目录：
[list]
[*][b]Ruby / Apache[/b]：把压缩包内的 recommended increased difficulty / vanilla difficulty 文件夹合并进对应 mod 根目录；
[*][b]Pack 10[/b]：压缩包已按 14 个配置、每个配置两个难度组织，直接合并进 Pack 10 的根目录即可。
[/list]
[*]确认游戏语言为简体中文，启动游戏。补丁只新增 msg/zhocn/，不会覆盖 mod 原文件。
[/list]

[b]卸载 / Uninstall[/b]
删除各难度目录 / 配置目录下的 msg/zhocn/ 文件夹即可。

[b]文件 / Files[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Ruby[/b]：对应 RNG Lands - Ruby；
[*][b]Apache[/b]：对应 RNG Lands - Apache；
[*][b]Pack 10[/b]：对应 RNG Lands - Pack 10（含全部 14 个配置 × 2 难度）。
[/list]

[b]已知问题 / Known issues[/b]
[list]
[*]极少数条目保持英文：它们是 mod 自身的 [ERROR] 占位条目（英文版同样显示 [ERROR]），不属于漏翻；
[*]服务条款（ToS）法律文本保持英文——官方简体中文文件里 ToS 本身也是英文；
[*]script/talk 与 event 文本不在本补丁范围内。
[*]如果你看到[b]本应翻译[/b]的物品名/菜单仍是英文，请在 Posts 里按“物品名 / 菜单位置”报给我。
[/list]

[b]致谢与授权 / Credits & Permissions[/b]
[list]
[*]原 mod：RNG Lands 作者（Nexus 3229）。所有原 mod 的功劳归原作者；本补丁不包含、也不重新分发原 mod 的任何文件。
[*]翻译：本补丁上传者。
[*][b]安装本补丁需要你自行安装原版 RNG Lands[/b]；本补丁仅分发翻译文本。
[*]转载/整合：请注明来源并保留本页面链接；请勿将“原 mod + 本补丁”合并后重新上传。
[/list]

[b]更新日志 / Changelog[/b]
[list]
[*][b]1.0[/b]（2026-10-17）：首个版本。覆盖 16 个内容组；物品名/说明、随机故事、菜单、教程与 HUD 全量中文。
[/list]

[line]

[b][size=5]English[/size][/b]

This patch provides a [b]Simplified Chinese[/b] translation for [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/3229]RNG Lands[/url] (Nexus mod 3229): item names & descriptions, randomizer story captions, menus, tutorials and system messages.
The package contains [b]translation text only[/b] (msg/zhocn DCX files) and no files from the original mod.

[b]Coverage[/b]
[list]
[*]~1.55M text slots (16 content groups) fully translated;
[*]~339k entries inherited from the official Simplified Chinese localization, the rest translated;
[*]Item names/descriptions, randomizer story text, menus, HUD and tutorial messages are covered.
[/list]

[b]Requirements[/b]
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/3229]RNG Lands 0.7.2[/url] (original mod required);
[*]Elden Ring 1.17.x;
[*]Game language must be set to [b]Simplified Chinese[/b];
[*]Both recommended increased difficulty and vanilla difficulty are supported.
[/list]

[b]Installation[/b]
[list]
[*]1. Install the original RNG Lands (Nexus 3229).
[*]2. Download the file matching your RNG Lands package (Ruby / Apache / Pack 10).
[*]3. Extract and merge into your RNG Lands mod root folder:
[list]
[*][b]Ruby / Apache[/b]: merge the included recommended increased difficulty / vanilla difficulty folders into your mod root;
[*][b]Pack 10[/b]: the archive already mirrors all 14 configs × 2 difficulties; merge it into the Pack 10 root.
[/list]
[*]Set the game language to Simplified Chinese and launch. The patch only adds msg/zhocn/ files.
[/list]

[b]Uninstall[/b]
Delete the msg/zhocn/ folders from the difficulty/config folders.

[b]Known issues[/b]
[list]
[*]A few entries remain English: they are the mod's own [ERROR] placeholder entries (English shows [ERROR] too), not missed translations;
[*]Terms of Service text remains English (the official Simplified Chinese files keep ToS in English as well);
[*]script/talk and event text are not covered by this patch;
[*]If a genuine item name/menu is still English, please report it with the item/menu location.
[/list]

[b]Credits & Permissions[/b]
[list]
[*]Original mod: RNG Lands by its author (Nexus 3229). All credit for the mod belongs to the original author; this patch contains no files from the original mod.
[*]Translation: uploader of this patch.
[*]You must install the original RNG Lands yourself. This patch distributes translation text only.
[*]Re-uploads/integrations: please credit this page and keep the link. Do not re-upload the original mod together with this patch.
[/list]

[b]Changelog[/b]
[list]
[*][b]1.0[/b] (2026-10-17): Initial release. 16 content groups; full Chinese item names/descriptions, randomizer stories, menus, tutorials and HUD.
[/list]
